<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
App 的隐私清单（project.yml 把它放进 DmIOS 包的资源；TestFlight / App Store 收包时核，缺了按 ITMS-91053 退回，直装不受影响）。
不跟踪、不收集数据（存档只进玩家自己的 iCloud 容器，更新检查只读一个版本文件，诊断日志由玩家自己点分享）。
用到的「须说明原因」的接口与原因：
  文件时间戳（stat 等，宿主存档 / 资源 / iCloud 同步比对修改时间）：C617.1 只看 App 容器、App Group 容器、App 自己 iCloud 容器里的文件。
  开机时间（mach_absolute_time：宿主计时、图形层测时）：35F9.1 只量 App 里两件事之间过了多久、做计时。
  磁盘空间（NSURLVolumeAvailableCapacityForImportantUsageKey、NSFileSystemFreeSize）：85F4.1 资源下载页给玩家看还差多少；
    E174.1 判空间够不够、不够就不下载并提示；7D9E.1 玩家自己点「分享诊断日志」时日志里带可用空间。
  UserDefaults（asset_dl.m 记上次用通的下载地址）：CA92.1 只读写 App 自己写的。
资源下载扩展 RomfsDownloader 只有系统缺省实现、不调这些接口，不另带清单。
The App's privacy manifest (project.yml puts it into the DmIOS bundle's resources; TestFlight / the App Store check it on upload and reject a build without it under ITMS-91053; direct installs are unaffected).
No tracking and no data collection (saves go only to the player's own iCloud container, the update check only reads a version file, the diagnostic log is shared only when the player taps Share).
Required-reason APIs used and their reasons:
  File timestamps (stat etc.: the host compares modification times of saves / resources / iCloud sync): C617.1 only files inside the app container, the App Group container and the app's own iCloud container.
  System boot time (mach_absolute_time: host timing, graphics timing): 35F9.1 only measuring elapsed time between events in the app and timers.
  Disk space (NSURLVolumeAvailableCapacityForImportantUsageKey, NSFileSystemFreeSize): 85F4.1 the resource download page shows the player how much space is missing;
    E174.1 checking whether there is enough space, and not downloading with a notice when there is not; 7D9E.1 the free space in the log the player chooses to share with "Share diagnostic log".
  UserDefaults (asset_dl.m remembers the download address that last worked): CA92.1 only reading and writing what the app itself wrote.
The resource download extension RomfsDownloader is only the system default implementation and calls none of these APIs, so it carries no manifest of its own.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>NSPrivacyTracking</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSPrivacyTrackingDomains</key>
	<array/>
	<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes</key>
	<array/>
	<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>C617.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategorySystemBootTime</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>35F9.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryDiskSpace</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>85F4.1</string>
				<string>E174.1</string>
				<string>7D9E.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>CA92.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
